# Testing Standards

<rules>
- Use `page.getByRole` or `page.getByLabel` for all locators.
- Never use class-based CSS selectors.
- Every new component MUST include an `aria-label`.
- Wrap logical journey steps in `test.step()`.
</rules>

<examples>
// Good
await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Submit' }).click();

// Bad
await page.locator('.btn-primary').click();
</examples>